WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:02.392
- But Taj, you place
fourth on Survivor, so

00:00:02.392 --> 00:00:03.390
- Ah

00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:04.380
- [Kelly] What's, that's

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:06.004
my sister, she's obsessed.

00:00:06.004 --> 00:00:07.148
(Audience applauding)

00:00:07.148 --> 00:00:09.090
[Kelly] This is like,
this is my sister's show.

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:10.440
She never missed one thing.

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:13.110
Yeah, so what's surprised you about it?

00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:15.750
And why would you do it? This
is my question for everyone.

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:18.720
- Okay, first of all, what
surprised me was that it was real

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:21.420
and I didn't really intend to do it.

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:23.640
I got a call to go on the show

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:27.030
that I had never watched
before or after I went on.

00:00:27.030 --> 00:00:27.863
- [Kelly] You didn't really

00:00:27.863 --> 00:00:28.710
- I didn't know what I was getting into.

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:30.370
- Oh my God, you thought
it was like a reality.

00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:31.260
- I thought it was reality.
- It was a fake reality.

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:35.961
- Yeah, it wasn't. There was
no toilet tissue, nothing.

00:00:35.961 --> 00:00:36.794
(audience laughing)

00:00:36.794 --> 00:00:38.760
- [Taj] I thought you'd
go out there and get dirty

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:39.960
they'd wash you off and you'd go home

00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:41.220
and start again the next day.

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:44.040
The cameras never go off.

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:45.960
- Oh my, well you did well though.

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:49.930
- Look, by the grace of God,
I was out there winning it.

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:50.870
(Audience applauding)

00:00:50.870 --> 00:00:53.520
- I love that you totally
didn't think it was

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:55.260
'cause people will be like reality TV

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:56.820
It's kind of real, you know, you probably.

00:00:56.820 --> 00:00:58.027
- [Kelly] That's a realization.

00:00:58.027 --> 00:01:01.170
- Oh gosh, no, it is real. It is real.

00:01:01.170 --> 00:01:02.850
- Wouldn't you ever do it again?

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:03.683
- No.

00:01:03.683 --> 00:01:04.950
(laughing)

00:01:04.950 --> 00:01:08.190
- So quick. Would anybody
here do that show?

00:01:08.190 --> 00:01:09.023
- Yeah,

00:01:09.023 --> 00:01:09.856
- [Kelly] Look at her (Kelly laughing)

00:01:09.856 --> 00:01:11.228
- Absolutely not.
- I've done a lot of reality

00:01:11.228 --> 00:01:13.423
shows but I was scared of that one.

